# Extra egress allowlist for the Rocket.Chat monorepo, merged into the kit's
# `permissions.network.allow` for workspaces on this profile. Exact hosts,
# host:port, single-label wildcards or CIDRs; `#` comments. Takes effect on
# `devbox rebuild` — a kit's rules are chosen at sandbox create time. See
# ../../allowed-domains.

# The two CIDRs that used to be here are gone. They named the bridge networks of
# containers/local-mongo and containers/observability, and a sandbox cannot route
# to either: it is a microVM with its own network namespace, so a host Docker
# network is not on it. Both stacks are reached through host.docker.internal
# instead, which the base allowlist grants — see the MONGO_URL note in `env`.

# --- What setup.sh downloads --------------------------------------------------
#
# These are new, and they are new because of *when* setup.sh now runs. Under the
# devcontainer it ran at updateContentCommand, before the firewall was applied,
# so it had unrestricted network and none of this had to be declared. A kit's
# setup.install runs inside the sandbox with the allowlist already in force, so
# every host the install reaches has to be here.
#
# The Meteor installer, and the warehouse it unpacks the ~1GB distribution from.
install.meteor.com
packages.meteor.com
static.meteor.com
warehouse.meteor.com

# Deno's install script. The release tarball itself comes from a GitHub release,
# which the base list already covers.
deno.land
dl.deno.land
